  {
    "__type__": "cc.Label",
    "_name": "",
    "_objFlags": 0,
    "node": {
      "__id__": 365
    },
    "_enabled": false,
    "_materials": [
      {
        "__uuid__": "eca5d2f2-8ef6-41c2-bbe6-f9c79d09c432"
      }
    ],
    "_srcBlendFactor": 770,
    "_dstBlendFactor": 771,
    "_string": "1. There are 7 regular symbols and 30 pay lines offered in the game.\n2. When the reels stop spinning and the first 3 symbols from left to right land on the activated pay line, you can win a basic prize.\n3. Each pay line is calculated separately. The more pay lines you activate, the ore prizes you may win.\n4. The bonus multiplier of each symbol is different. Prize payout = bet amount x bonus multiplier. See details below:",
